  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Gingerbread Cookie.png|alt=|left|199x199px|Gingerbread Cookie]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 86\n |price = 1 to 273\n |time = 30 min\n |xp = 33\n |source = {{Infoicon|Bakery|bigger|link=Bakery}}\n |base = 76\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 25 min\n}}\n'''Gingerbread Cookies''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 86.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making gingerbread cookies'''===\n[[File:Bakery.png|150px|left|link=Bakery|Bakery]]\nGingerbread cookies are made in the [[Bakery]].\n\nTo make a gingerbread cookies, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|Wheat|link=Wheat]]\n|[[File:Butter.png|75px|Butter|link=Butter]]\n|[[File:Syrup.png|75px|link=Syrup|Syrup]]\n|[[File:Ginger.png|75px|link=Ginger|Ginger]]\n|-\n|'''x5'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|}\nIt takes 30 minutes to make one cookie, and 25 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] Bakery. Each cookie gives players 33 {{Infoicon|xp}} points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling gingerbread cookies'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|link=Roadside Shop|Roadside Shop]]\n\n*Cookies can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,736 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 units.\n*Buying the ingredients required to make a cookie costs 243 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|link=Boat|Riverboat]]\n\n*[[Boat]] orders ask for 2 cookies per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Lebkuchenkeks\n|es = Galleta de jengibre\n|fr = Bonhomme en Pain D'Epice\n|it = Biscotto di pan di zenzero\n|nl = Peperkoeken Mannetje\n|no = Pepperkake\n|ru = Пряник\n|zh = Gingerbread Cookie\n}}\n[[pt-br:Biscoito de gengibre]]\n\n